/Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG/500px-Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Madeira_Grey_Cat.JPG","share":0.100625},{"title":"Scala di grigi","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Scala_di_grigi.jpg/500px-Scala_di_grigi.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scala_di_grigi.jpg","share":0.09375},{"title":"Grey-crowned Babblers 1605","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Grey-crowned_Babblers_1605.jpg/500px-Grey-crowned_Babblers_1605.jpg","ratio":1.499851676060516,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey-crowned_Babblers_1605.jpg","share":0.0925},{"title":"Man tapping balsam, late 15th century. Wellcome L0019170","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Man_tapping_balsam%2C_late_15th_century._Wellcome_L0019170.jpg/500px-Man_tapping_balsam%2C_late_15th_century._Wellcome_L0019170.jpg","ratio":0.7673830594184576,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_tapping_balsam,_late_15th_century._Wellcome_L0019170.jpg","share":0.08875},{"title":"Abies balsamea 960627 24a","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Abies_balsamea_960627_24a.jpg/500px-Abies_balsamea_960627_24a.jpg","ratio":0.6587837837837838,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Abies_balsamea_960627_24a.jpg","share":0.078125}]}}